#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:1
msgid "Source Installation on MacOS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:3
msgid ""
"This tutorial will work for MacOS Mojave 10.14 and MacOS Catalina 10.15."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:5
msgid "Install tools"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:7
msgid ""
"The use of some additional tools is recommended to help with the source "
"compilation, although other ways of correctly getting and building the "
"sources are also possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:10
msgid ""
"The easiest way to get the sources of all libraries is to use [vcstool]"
"(https://github.com/dirk-thomas/vcstool)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:13
msgid ""
"To compile all the different libraries and ign-gazebo in the right order "
"[colcon](https://colcon.readthedocs.io/en/released/) is recommended. The "
"colcon tool is available on all platforms using pip (or pip3, if pip fails)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:17
msgid "Python3 from homebrew"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:19
msgid ""
"Tools and dependencies for Dome can be installed using the [homebrew package "
"manager](https://brew.sh/). The homebrew tool can be installed by entering "
"the following in a terminal:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:22
msgid ""
"/bin/bash -c \"$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/"
"install/master/install.sh)\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:26
msgid ""
"Dome is compatible with Python3; it can be installed by running the "
"following in a terminal:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:28
msgid "brew install python3\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:32
msgid "vcstool and colcon from pip"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:34
msgid "PIP is available on all platforms:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:36
msgid "python3 -m pip install vcstool\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:40
msgid "python3 -m pip install -U colcon-common-extensions\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:44
msgid "Getting the sources"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:46
msgid ""
"The first step is to create a developer workspace in which `vcstool` and "
"`colcon` can work:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:49
msgid ""
"mkdir -p ~/workspace/src\n"
"cd ~/workspace/src\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:54
msgid ""
"All the sources of ignition-dome are declared in a yaml file. Download it to "
"the workspace:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:57
msgid ""
"wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ignition-tooling/gazebodistro/master/"
"collection-dome.yaml\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:61
msgid ""
"Use `vcstool` to automatically retrieve all the Ignition libraries sources "
"from their repositories:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:64
msgid "vcs import < collection-dome.yaml\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:68
msgid "The src subdirectory should contain all the sources ready to be built."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:71
msgid "Install dependencies"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:73
msgid "Add `osrf/simulation` to Homebrew formulae"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:75
msgid ""
"brew update\n"
"brew tap osrf/simulation\n"
"brew trust osrf/simulation\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:81
msgid "Install all dependencies:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:83
msgid "Dependency for Ogre:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:85
msgid "brew cask install xquartz\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:89
msgid "General dependencies:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:91
msgid ""
"brew install assimp boost bullet cmake cppzmq dartsim@6.10.0 doxygen eigen "
"fcl ffmpeg flann freeimage freetype gflags google-benchmark gts ipopt "
"irrlicht jsoncpp libccd libyaml libzzip libzip nlopt ode open-scene-graph "
"ossp-uuid ogre1.9 ogre2.1 pkg-config protobuf qt qwt rapidjson ruby tbb "
"tinyxml tinyxml2 urdfdom zeromq\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:95
msgid ""
"`dartsim@6.10.0` and `qt5` are not sym-linked. To use those dependencies "
"when building `ignition-physics2` and `ignition-gui3`, run the following "
"after installation to add them to `/use/local`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:98
msgid ""
"# dartsim@6.10.0\n"
"export CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=${CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH}:/usr/local/opt/dartsim@6.10.0\n"
"export DYLD_FALLBACK_LIBRARY_PATH=${DYLD_FALLBACK_LIBRARY_PATH}:/usr/local/"
"opt/dartsim@6.10.0/lib:/usr/local/opt/octomap/local\n"
"export PKG_CONFIG_PATH=${PKG_CONFIG_PATH}:/usr/local/opt/dartsim@6.10.0/lib/"
"pkgconfig\n"
"# qt5\n"
"export CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=${CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH}:/usr/local/opt/qt@5\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:107
msgid "Install compiler requirements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:109
msgid "The Ignition Libraries require the Xcode 10 compiler on MacOS Mojave."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:111
msgid ""
"On Mac machines, gcc is acquired by installing Xcode command line tools. The "
"required version of Xcode for Dome is Xcode 10.3, which can be downloaded "
"from [Apple Developer Site](https://developer.apple.com/download/more/). You "
"will need to sign in to your Apple account and download the Mojave version "
"of Xcode command line tools. Command line tools can also be obtained by "
"downloading Xcode from the Apple App Store (installing the full app may take "
"over an hour)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:118
msgid "Building the Ignition Libraries in MacOS Catalina (10.15)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:120
msgid ""
"If you want to compile Ignition Libraries in MacOS Catalina (10.15) you will "
"need to apply some patches in your filesystem:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:122
msgid ""
"`/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/"
"Developer/SDKs/MacOSX10.15.sdk/System/Library/Frameworks/Ruby.framework/"
"Headers/ruby/ruby/intern.h`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:124
msgid "Create a file called `intern.patch` with the following content:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:126
msgid ""
"--- intern.h    2019-12-16 18:17:08.000000000 +0100\n"
"+++ /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/"
"Developer/SDKs/MacOSX10.15.sdk/System/Library/Frameworks/Ruby.framework/"
"Headers/ruby/ruby/intern.h\n"
"@@ -14,6 +14,10 @@\n"
" #ifndef RUBY_INTERN_H\n"
" #define RUBY_INTERN_H 1\n"
"\n"
"+#if __cplusplus > 199711L\n"
"+#define register      // Deprecated in C++11.\n"
"+#endif  // #if __cplusplus > 199711L\n"
"+\n"
" #if defined(__cplusplus)\n"
" extern \"C\" {\n"
" #if 0\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:142 ../../../install_osx_src.md:166
msgid "Now we can apply the patch:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:144
msgid "sudo patch -p0 < intern.patch\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:148
msgid ""
"`/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/"
"Developer/SDKs/MacOSX10.15.sdk/System/Library/Frameworks/Ruby.framework/"
"Headers/ruby/ruby/config.h`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:150
msgid "Create a file called `config.patch` with the following content:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:152
msgid ""
"--- config.h    2019-12-16 18:19:13.000000000 +0100\n"
"+++ /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/"
"Developer/SDKs/MacOSX10.15.sdk/System/Library/Frameworks/Ruby.framework/"
"Headers/ruby/ruby/config.h\n"
"@@ -410,6 +410,6 @@\n"
" #define RUBY_PLATFORM_CPU \"x86_64\"\n"
" #endif /* defined __x86_64__ &&! defined RUBY_PLATFORM_CPU */\n"
" #define RUBY_PLATFORM_OS \"darwin19\"\n"
"-#define RUBY_ARCH\"universal-\"RUBY_PLATFORM_OS\n"
"-#define RUBY_PLATFORM\"universal.\"RUBY_PLATFORM_CPU\"-\"RUBY_PLATFORM_OS\n"
"+#define RUBY_ARCH \"universal-\" RUBY_PLATFORM_OS\n"
"+#define RUBY_PLATFORM \"universal.\" RUBY_PLATFORM_CPU \"-\" "
"RUBY_PLATFORM_OS\n"
" #endif /* INCLUDE_RUBY_CONFIG_H */\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:168
msgid "sudo patch -p0 < config.patch\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:172
msgid "Building the Ignition Libraries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:174
msgid ""
"Once the compiler and all the sources are in place it is time to compile "
"them. Start the procedure by changing into the workspace and listing the "
"packages recognized by `colcon`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:178
msgid ""
"cd ~/workspace/\n"
"colcon graph\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:183
msgid ""
"`colcon graph` should list the Ignition libraries with an [interdependency "
"diagram](https://colcon.readthedocs.io/en/released/reference/verb/graph."
"html#example-output). If that is the case, then you are ready to build the "
"whole set of libraries:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:188
msgid "colcon build --merge-install\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:192
msgid "To speed up the build process, you could also disable tests by using"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:194
msgid "colcon build --cmake-args -DBUILD_TESTING=OFF --merge-install\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:198
msgid "To build a specific package with all its dependent packages:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:200
msgid "colcon build --merge-install --packages-up-to PACKAGE_NAME\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:204
msgid "To build a single package:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:206
msgid "colcon build --merge-install --packages-select PACKAGE_NAME\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:210
msgid ""
"Visit [colcon documentation](https://colcon.readthedocs.io/en/released/#) to "
"view more `colcon` build and test options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:212
msgid "If there are no errors, all the binaries should be ready to use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:214
msgid "Using the workspace"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:216
msgid "The workspace needs to be sourced every time a new terminal is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:218
msgid "Run the following command to source the workspace in bash:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:220
msgid ". ~/workspace/install/setup.bash\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:224
msgid "Or in zsh:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:226
msgid ". ~/workspace/install/setup.zsh\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:230
msgid ""
"This is the end of the source install instructions; head back to the "
"[Getting started](getstarted) page to start using Ignition!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:233
msgid "Uninstalling source-based install"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:235
msgid ""
"If you need to uninstall Ignition or switch to a binary-based install once "
"you have already installed the library from source, navigate to your source "
"code directory's build folders and run `make uninstall`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx_src.md:239
msgid ""
"cd /workspace\n"
"sudo make uninstall\n"
msgstr ""

